<title>USA: Marshfield, Wis., $2.405 mln won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Marshfield, Wis., $2.405 mln won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $2.405 million of Marshfield, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997 A, with a net interest cost of 4.74 percent.</p>
